IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgba-nouns`

-- INSTRUMENT: Broadcasting (Class Licence) (Amendment) Notification 2020 (S 478/2020), made under s 9 of the Act.
-- Deposit: ../../../broadcasting-class-licence-amendment-notification-2020/registers/source-bundle/BA1994-S478-2020.txt (e-Gazette PDF, pdftotext -layout, unedited). Quotations below are lines of THAT file; `srcrefs.py` is run on this module against it.
-- First published 22 June 2020 at 5 pm; "comes into operation on 22 June 2020" (paragraph 1).
-- It amends paragraph 3A of the Broadcasting (Class Licence) Notification (N 1) by adding sub-paragraph (4). The Class Licence Notification is encoded in `sgba-i-class-licence.l4` (lawplain) without its Schedule.

§ `Paragraph 2: paragraph 3A(4) added`

-- src:3 | First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 22 June 2020 at 5 pm.
-- src:20 | 1. This Notification is the Broadcasting (Class Licence)
-- src:21 | (Amendment) Notification 2020 and comes into operation on
-- src:22 | 22 June 2020.
@ref S 478/2020 publication line and para 1 (commencement) (src:3-22)
GIVEN `the day of the conduct` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 478/2020 the amendment is in operation on` MEANS
    `the day of the conduct` AT LEAST (Date 22 6 2020)

-- src:25 | 2. Paragraph 3A of the Broadcasting (Class Licence) Notification
-- src:26 | (N 1) is amended by inserting, immediately after sub-paragraph (3),
-- src:27 | the following sub-paragraph:
-- src:28 | “(4) This Notification also does not apply to or in relation to a
-- src:29 | person who is a class licensee by virtue of the Broadcasting
-- src:30 | (Class Licence — Broadcasting to Digital Display Panels)
-- src:31 | Notification 2020 (G.N. No. S 477/2020).”.
@ref S 478/2020 para 2: N 1 para 3A(4): the Notification does not apply to a person who is a class licensee by virtue of the Digital Display Panels Notification 2020 (S 477/2020) (src:25-31)
GIVEN `the person is a class licensee by virtue of the Broadcasting (Class Licence - Broadcasting to Digital Display Panels) Notification 2020 (S 477/2020)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 478/2020 N 1 para 3A(4) the Class Licence Notification (N 1) applies to the person` MEANS
    NOT `the person is a class licensee by virtue of the Broadcasting (Class Licence - Broadcasting to Digital Display Panels) Notification 2020 (S 477/2020)`
